e traffickers are getting  more sophisticated so we must try to  keep up with them  in line with the times that is  is everything okay  sure  why aren't they leaving  what the hell are they doing  it looks as if they know  they won't get out of the way  they found two boxes  they knew  [ __ ]  in the wire tappings the message of two  members of the roman group  it was march 29 2014  were ready to collect a drug shipment  preceded them  they seized 220 kilograms of cocaine  right under the nose  the loss of the shipment triggered the  anger and the suspicion of the boss  i am asking you you didn't take it  where the hell did it go was it seized  i sent you 2 million euros just like  that  the logistics of the organization was a  house in the outskirts of rome where the  affiliates brought the huge proceeds of  drug trafficking and then sorted them in  various money laundering operations with  the support of some above suspicion  financial brokers  hundreds of thousands of euros a week  in that house we recorded a few  encounters with white-collar workers but  they were crucial as a positive feedback  we managed to record periodically  at regular intervals the use of money  counting machines  it was a sound we heard in our  wiretappings  i'll get the money now and deliver it at  the usual place  yes  when will i get it in brazil  in a week  i want them in dollars  i'll contact someone i know  do you trust him  it once happened to me that we had  invested seven millions and a guy came  by with a woman and the money  disappeared with the woman so i went to  see her family and i took her children  two hours later and i mean two hours  exactly the woman was there and brought  [Music]  the drug trafficking money in south  america purchasing new batches of  cocaine  a well-oiled vicious cycle of dozens of  operations per month  the investigators managed to retrace one  of them for a total of 1.4 million euros  in may 2014.  to make this money transfer the head of  the clan 