ness model has a  prominent role i am trying to develop a  wider strategy  a real multi-energy strategy starting  from our core business  in the oil sector  raphael tonyaka is an engineer from  belzona with a brilliant professional  and political career behind him  former president of the plr belzona  candidate to the grand council and  manager of the power company intesino  he held positions in leading energy and  oil companies in italy  we could say that it was all stemming  from a family relationship  the merging of two complementary figures  on one side the experience of an  international manager represented by  rafael taniaka and on the other a young  engineer with a prospective growth  represented by myself  [Music]  founded the viva group involving in the  project for a short period his cousin  flavio petraglio  the group consists of several companies  primarily engaged in real estate and  energy  part of this holding according to its  presentation on the internet is also  viva transfer  a money transfer agency of which on the  commercial registry the sole director  appears to be raphael toniaca's wife  and it was viva transfer that took  delivery of those 1.4 million euros sent  by kosimoto  viva transfer was a company of the group  which specifically dealt with money  transfers  on an operative level what i saw was a  number of individuals bringing their  money which was then sorted or  transferred rather through the banks to  the banks of the receiving countries  in particular i remember brazil surely  among the companies of the group viva  transfer was the one with the highest  profits  was a man who established himself abroad  and wasn't very well known here  abroad he operated in the field of  energy and renewable energy of major  importance then he came back  he had the profile we were looking for  to convince the younger generation of  liberals who are also somewhat green  in 2011 raphael tonyaka was backed into  politics and became one of the  candidates of the plr to the state  council  but his candidacy lasted a few days he  was asked to step back for his alleged  involvement in the legal proceedings  linked to his previous job in the energy  sector although the manager was not  under investigation  at first it took us all by surprise  such a newsworthy matter which then  folded and nothing came of  could you tell us why you left  i did not leave because of obvious  problems  before different views which were also  strategic without underlining who was  right and who was wrong  what i saw in the last months  was a will to intensify the activities  relating to brazil rather than to tesino  where professionally i feel more  connected and oriented  about the current case regarding the  alleged money laundering rafael tonyaka  did not wish to comment  his lawyer claimed that he was not under  investigation in switzerland or in italy  but rafael tonyaka and his wife the  presumption of innocent supplies  the fact is that according to the  italian investigation 1.4 million euros  cash were transferred from italy to  brazil through viva transfer a financial  intermediary in switzerland  according to the law against money  laundering  intermediaries should specify the origin  and the recipient of the money reporting  all suspicious cases  if this happened we do not know  the swiss anti-laundering authority  which we contacted did not comment  it's hard to think that someone  delivering to another person 1.4 million  euros cash would tell them  this is the money coming from and  delivered to me by x  whoever does this job know exactly what  they are doing  mainly there is also a problem about the  way the money was delivered since it was  1.4 million euros in cash  namely the way the money was received in  canton tesino  we took care of whatever brought it here  but the part that fell under our  jurisdiction  in switzerland did you get an answer  this is part of an ongoing investigation  at the moment i do not wish to